window.products.push({"id":375074,"name":"Ewen 25.6x17.5 Inch Large Silicone Kitchen Counter Mat, 2MM Thick Heat Resistant Countertop Protector, Silicone Mat Under Air Fryer, Toaster Oven, Mic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nfSnUrgKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Large Size: 25.6x17.5 inches mat, big enough for covering a large work area and keeping everything together on 1 place, protecting your tabletop and countertop for appliances, make food prep and baking easier, provides safe and clean environment for dining and cooking. Premium Material: Made of all food-grade silicone material and BPA-free. Can withstand temperatures from -40 to 446°F, providing better insulation. No odor. Non-fading. Non-staining. Not easy to deform or tear up. 1 side which has a glossy finish is sticky and grips very well on the countertop, but is easily removed if rolled from 1 side. Place this non-slip side down to prevent the appliance from sliding around. The other side is matte, non-stick, and suitable for baking and making pies You Can’t Go Wrong with It: This placemat can solve multiple problems. Great for catching messes. Protect counters from spills, scratches, grease, coffee stains, or damage. Place hot items of all sizes directly on the mat without having to dig through the drawer for a hot pad and no more need for trivets. Reduce the noises made by appliances. No need to worry about items slipping off the countertop. Tools will keep in place. Even if you are rolling dough hard on it, the mat won't slide Easy to Clean & Store: Washable, reusable, and dishwasher safe. Quick and easy cleanup with a damp dish cloth or kitchen towel. Dyes, acrylic paint and pigment inks can be wiped off. Easy to peel off solder drops, glue and hardened resins. Can be rolled up or folded for easy storage and portability Versatile Silicone Mat: Can be used as a stove top cover for electric stove or induction cooktop, but cannot be used while they are working. This dryer top protector mat can be placed under microwave, air fryer, hot plate, oven, coffee maker and grill for protection from heat. A workbench mat for polymer clay, repairs, woodworking, gluing, painting, coloring, embossing and stamping. It can be also used for doing nails, makeup, acrylic pouring, wax, epoxy resin, art & crafts","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nfSnUrgKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ewen","source_asin":"B09BQBMS9C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-375074","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BQBMS9C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BQBMS9C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
