window.products.push({"id":375176,"name":"Electric Deep Fryer w/Basket & Lid, 3000W 20.7QT Commercial Deep Fryer, Countertop Kitchen Frying Machine, Stainless Steel French Fryer with Temperatu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":115.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J0PN2WBGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★【POWERFUL DEEP FRYER】This electric fryer is equipped with an immersed heating element that makes the oil heat faster and maintains oil temperature before and during use. Always provide uniformly fried, crispy, and delicious food; You can fry chips, fish, chicken, doughnuts, fritters, onion rings, shrimp, French fries, etc. Great for home and commercial uses, such as restaurants, supermarkets, fast food stands, snack bars, parties. ★【LARGE CAPACITY】20.7QT extra-large capacity allows you to prepare family sized quantities as well as saving space. Dual electrical heads and power plugs, which let you fry two different foods at two different temperatures! It can save your time to make the different food. 2 x 6.35QT removable baskets, allowing you to quickly drain and remove food from the fryer. ★【SAFE TO USE & EASY TO CLEAN】Come with Lid cover and Removable baskets. The lid cover prevents the boiling oil from splashing and safely covers the oil when not in use. And the fryer baskets with plastic handle prevents scalding of your hands; the basket includes hooks for easy oil draining. Residue plate for filtering out the dregs, both the detachable fry basket and oil tank are easy to clean. ★【RESET BUTTON & ADJUSTABLE TEMPERATURE】 Electric Deep Fryer design with temperature control function and a heating indicator light. Adjustable heat control range: 60°C - 200°C (140°F - 392°F). The temperature indicator light displays when the fryer is heating the oil. It will power off automatically when the temperature is over 230℃. ★【EASY OPERATION】 One temperature knob controls the tank separately, then you can choose the right temperature according to the food. 1700-watt immersion element each fryer tank provides quick preheating and fast oil temperature recovery, U-shaped stainless steel heating tubes for evenly heat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J0PN2WBGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wesoky","source_asin":"B07ZF8KX15","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-375176","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZF8KX15","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZF8KX15","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
