window.products.push({"id":375196,"name":"VSITOO S3pro Temperature Control Smart Mug 2 with Lid, Self Heating Coffee Mug 14 oz, 90 Min Battery Life - APP & Manual Controlled Heated Coffee Mug ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513sGR74LyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕ 【Manual&App Control】 Temperature can be adjusted directly through the touch button on the smart travel coffee mug or the VSITOO APP on your phone. Choose the way to set your favorite temperature between 96℉- 149℉.The best drinking temperature for coffee is 131℉- 145℉ in summer and 140℉- 149℉in winter. ❤ 【Excellent Battery Life】 This smart coffee thermos mug works with 2500Ah high-capacity polymer lithium battery, VSITOO S3 Pro smart mug can last 1.5-8 hours on a single full charge—or all day on the charging coaster, which keeps your coffee at the perfect temperature from the first sip to the last drop. 🎁 【Unique Design】 The coffee mug body is made of double-layer vacuum stainless steel and the inside adopts advanced Food Grade Ceramic Acrylic Paint Technology. Double vacuum insulation make it possible to keep your drink warm. The intelligent heating system allows you to drink perfect coffee or tea every morning. IPX7 waterproof rating allows you to clean the smart mug more safely. The included BPA free sliding lid also brings you more convenience. 💖 【SMART LED LIGHT】The LED temperature light bar indicates the heating process, and the aperture of the touch button show the current beverage temperature and battery power. Blue：《35℃（95℉）, Orange：36-50℃（96-122℉）, RED：》50℃（122℉）, Green：Show Charging 🎁【Perfect gift choice】 New design. Keep your coffee always warm. This coffee mug will be the perfect gift for your lover, family or best friend on your birthday, christmas, father's day, mother's day, anniversary or other important occasions. ☕【Hand Wash Only】 An updated double-layer vacuum stainless steel coating is safe to hand wash. S3 PRO is IPX7 rated and you can wash your cup easier. 🎁【Extended Battery Life】 Pour in hot liquid to extend and maximize battery life. ☕【Included With Smart Mug】 Charging coaster, mug lid, adapter, and quick start guide. 🎁【Need Help】 If the parts missing or any product questions, pls contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513sGR74LyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"vsitoo","source_asin":"B0B873J8TC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-375196","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B873J8TC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B873J8TC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
