window.products.push({"id":375229,"name":"AKTI Premium Quality Hand Towel 410 GSM 100% Cotton 20x34 Inches Pack of 6 | Highly Absorbent, Soft & Fluffy Hand Towels for Bathroom, Gym, Spa, Kitch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RnCb59BpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Quality : AKTI cotton towels are highly durable and special absorptive hand towels are made with premium 100% cotton 410 GSM leading to rapid soak up of water. Good manufacturing practice of these hand towel is the key to their strength and long-lasting comfort for everyone. They come in a very reasonable size of 20x34 inches. AKTI hand towels are the key for practical use as they are portable and lightweight. Treat Yourself with Luxury : It’s time to take care of your hands! Take all the moisture out of your hands, leaving a gentle feel behind. Perfectly sized, super handy, multi-purpose, amazingly absorbent, 100% durable, super soft, and fluffy cotton hand towels . Soak in that clean and fresh feeling and enhance your daily routine with our plush, premium towels. They are overly absorbent hand towels. Certification & Safety : That’s a duo! Along with hand hygiene, this towel has been marked safe to use by the OKEO-TEX certification. This claims that the towel contains no toxic substances and declares it safe for you, your household members and fulfils all the standards for clean and secured environment. Perfect for Everyday Use: Ideally sized at 20x34 inches, these cotton hand towels are perfect for daily use. The high GSM of 410 makes these hand towels super soft, extra absorbent and fluffy. Easy care: AKTI hand towels are easily washed in a washing machine. Use warm water and mild detergent. Make sure that you dry the towel quickly so that no mildew remains on it. Wash your towels separately from other clothes in order to inhibit the transfer of lint to clothes. Protect your towels from over drying. Furthermore, prohibit the use of fabric softeners so that the fresh fluffiness and mushy nature of towel remains intact.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RnCb59BpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AKTI","source_asin":"B085LGMSKV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-375229","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085LGMSKV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085LGMSKV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
