window.products.push({"id":375403,"name":"ARDOUR VAN Lamptap Hot Cocoa Bomb Mold, 2.5 Inch Silicone Sphere Mold, 2pcs Large Semi Sphere Silicone Mold for Hot Chocolate Bombs, Cake, Dome Mousse","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wXODeKwPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With this mold, you can make amazing desserts with your family and enjoy the happy time of making desserts together. In addition, it can make popular food as gifts for your relatives, friends. So add to the shopping cart now! Specifications: One Half Ball Size: Dia 2.55 inchesPackage Included: 2 * Large cocoa bomb molds Notes: 1.The first time, Put the round silicone mold in boiling water for 5 minutes to remove the smell of silicone itself.2.It is best to place the mold on the pallet when moving the mold because the mold itself is relatively soft.3.After baking, please leave the baking mold cooling for 10 minutes before the mold unloading for a better effect.4.Do not use in fire.5.Do not use knives or other sharp tolls on silicone mold and avoid stress, pull. Service: We provide reliable after-sales service and return service, if you encounter any problems, we will reply within 12 hours and help you solve the problem. Brand story: The founder of William Thomas is a baking lover. In 2019, when William was trying to make hot chocolate bombs, he encountered a tricky problem when he first started using plastic molds. The cooled chocolate was difficult to remove from the mold and was easy to break. William actively seeks a solution. Research has found that the silicone material has the conditions to solve this problem. After rigorous comparison and testing, it finally produced a good product capable of these tasks, with suitable softness and perfect size. William hopes to bring this product to people who need it at this time, so the lamptap brand was born.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wXODeKwPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"lamptap","source_asin":"B08PDJWDXB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-375403","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PDJWDXB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PDJWDXB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
