window.products.push({"id":375453,"name":"BOHO URBAN Bohemian Hippie Pink Tapestries, Indian Dorm Decor, Psychedelic Tapestry Wall Hanging Ethnic Decorative (Pink)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wB388gjlL._AC_.jpg","description":"A wonderful example of Indian craftsmanship.Tapestry is a form of textile art, traditionally woven on a vertical loom. Tapestry is weft-faced weaving, in which all the warp threads are hidden in the completed work, unlike cloth weaving where both the warp and the weft threads may be visible. This gorgeous tapestry can be used for a wall hanging, a table cloth, a bedspread, furniture throw, curtains, Yoga Mat home decor, and more. - The colors are vivid and the pattern will probably fit in most places. - It is a great size, has vibrant colors, and looks great on bedroom or dorm room wall! - It's not too flimsy - The material is solid, the edges are finished, it isn't too thick or thin (though I suppose that depends what you want to use it for). - The colors are prettier than some of the original pictures make them look.. - The size is great. The measurements of tapestry is pretty accurate - Perfect to sit on the beach or hang on a wall. Pattern is clear, precise and even throughout. Overall, you will be very pleased with this product. These Tapestries are completely screen printed in traditional Indian method . 100% Cotton - This tapestry are printed, not quilted or woven. They are hippie Indian tapestries. Thin as sheet. Good, tight power loom construction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wB388gjlL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOHO URBAN","source_asin":"B07GSXGN3J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-375453","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GSXGN3J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GSXGN3J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
