window.products.push({"id":375641,"name":"12\" Maritime Antique Porthole Round Window Glass Nautical Boat Ship Porthole Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lPod3i3WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Porthole, Sometimes Called Bull's-Eye Is A Generally Circular Metallic Frame Used On The Hull Of Ships To Admit Light And Air. Though The Term Is Of Maritime Origin, It Is Also Used To Describe Round Circular Openings On Armored Vehicles, Aircraft, Automobiles And Even Spacecraft etc | On A Ship, The Function Of A Porthole, When Open Is To Permit Light And Fresh Air To Enter The Dark And Often Damp Below-Deck Quarters Of The Vessel. It Also Affords Below-Deck Occupants A Limited View To The Outside World When Closed In Ancient Times | Our Replica Is Still As Functional As Ancient Times But Not 100% Air-Tight / Air Proof. It Is A Classy And Quality Accent Piece To Add To Any Nautical Themed Room. This Charming Nautical Port Is Both Functional And Stylish. This Beautiful Porthole Will Accent Your Nautical Wall Decor Perfectly. Place This Item In Your Lake House, Bar, Or Any Other Nautical Themed Room You Can Imagine. This Mediterranean-Style Wall Mounting Decor Ornament Is Perfect Choice For Living Room, Home Or Shop, Office, Pirate Themes Room, Seaside Gardens, Patio, Tiki-Bar, Floating Tiki, Nature Adventurous Wild Camps, Vans etc. Possibilities Are Endless & Limitless.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lPod3i3WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Marine Nautical Store","source_asin":"B083M4RDH7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-375641","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083M4RDH7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083M4RDH7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":375642,"name":"Stainless Steel Food Container & Condiment Holder | Leak Proof Silicone Lid | Metal Lunch Box | Bento Box | Portion Control Snacks Dressings [2 PCS Se","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31W5YApyOqL._AC_.jpg","description":"✅ WE'RE NOT A FAN OF CHEMICALS EITHER: It’s scary how many food containers still contain chemicals like BPA, BPS and Phthalates. We believe eventually this stuff will be regulated and all food containers will be made with “clean material”. Until then, best to stay ahead of the curve. Whether you buy our product (which is free of BPA, BPS and Phthalates) or another brand we hope you and your family (and even your nasty neighbor) steer clear of these chemicals. ✅ WAIT, THERE ARE DIFFERENT TYPES OF SILICONE?: Yup. We didn’t know this either until we started manufacturing our silicone lids. Unfortunately, a lot of silicone has “filler” mixed in with the silicone because it’s a lot cheaper to make. We only use 100% Pure LFGB Silicone (the highest quality available) and we don’t “cut it’ with any fillers. ✅ 100% LEAKPROOF AND EASY TO OPEN (YES, FINALLY!): Easier said than done. It only took us 4 months to create a custom silicone mold that’s easy enough for anyone to open; and still 100% Leakproof. In fact, I pack mine upside-down in my lunch bag just for kicks. ✅ WHAT’S IN THIS SET?: Looking for the Perfect Duo? Look no further. We paired our Large 24oz capacity bento box with a convenient leak-proof condiment / dipping container. The big guy is great for your main meal; and the “little buddy” loves to tag along with his main goal in life to keep your meal from getting over saturated or soggy with dressing. He also feels extra special when used for dipping vegetables into hummus. ✅ WARRANTY: Buy with confidence. Love it, or return it for a full refund. No Hassle Processing and no forms to print and mail. Simply contact Bklyn Bento via the company’s online Warranty Page.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31W5YApyOqL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BKLYN BENTO PEACE & LOVE FROM BROOKLYN, N.Y.","source_asin":"B07TTF871J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-375642","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TTF871J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TTF871J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
