window.products.push({"id":375944,"name":"Peurif Kitchen Wheat Straw Dinnerware Sets, Dinner Plates, Dessert Plate, Cereal Bowls, Unbreakable Plastic Outdoor Camping Dishes (Pink, Service for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DtiqeFDLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"12-piece dinnerware set, includes 4 x dinner plates, 4 x dessert plates and 4 x bowls. The dinnerware set is made from natural wheat straw fiber and PP material. This dinner set is sturdy and durable, stackable to save place in kitchen cabinet. This tableware set is dishwasher and freezer safe and is suitable for a nice picnic or just at home. The wheat straw dinnerware is perfect for every meal, serving pasta, sandwich, bread and butter, dessert, soup, rice, salad, appetizer, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DtiqeFDLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peurif","source_asin":"B08QYNNN2T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-375944","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QYNNN2T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QYNNN2T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":375945,"name":"White Mountain F64306-X 6-Quart Hand-Crank Ice Cream Freezer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41nbpqxSUFL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Sunbeam ice cream maker, series: White Mountain, hand cranked, manual, 6 qt Capacity, stainless steel canister body, includes: recipes, Brown Color. Amazon.com For a century and a half, since a woman in New York invented the hand-crank freezer, making ice cream has been an American family value. Mom blended the ice cream mixture; Dad filled the maker's wooden tub with ice and rock salt to achieve the below-freezing temperature needed to produce smooth confections; kids clamored to turn the crank; and everyone happily consumed big bowls of ice cream as a reward. This family-bonding activity remains as vibrant today as it was through a century-and-a-half of \"progress.\" With various ice cream, frozen yogurt, and sherbet recipes included, this old-fashioned White Mountain ice cream maker maintains the tradition. Only the use of modern stainless steel for the freezer can and dasher distinguishes this rugged maker from the one earlier generations enjoyed. And years from now it will still be used, knitting together a family's history. --Fred Brack From the Manufacturer Enjoy a sweet treat! Bring back memories and create new ones by cranking the old-fashioned way. You’ll savor the flavors and the stories when you make ice cream with your family and friends. Great for parties, family get-togethers, and warm summer days, the large 6-quart hand-cranked ice cream maker is the life of any party. At a Glance New England white pine bucket New England white pine bucket Corrosion-resistant, cast-iron, triple-action dasher Corrosion-resistant, cast-iron, triple-action dasher Three-gear drive hand-cranked system Three-gear drive hand-cranked system Steel inner bucket Steel inner bucket Makes 6 quarts of ice cream in 30 to 45 minutes Makes 6 quarts of ice cream in 30 to 45 minutes 5-year limited warranty 5-year limited warranty Recipes included Recipes included Features Bucket: The wood bucket is crafted of select pine from New England and bound with strong galvanized hoops and electroplated fittings to ensure lasting stability. Bucket: The wood bucket is crafted of select pine from New England and bound with strong galvanized hoops and electroplated fittings to ensure lasting stability. Canister: The tall canister design allows the ice cream to come in close contact with the ice and rock salt making it freeze faster. Our canister is manufactured of heavy-duty stainless steel that will provide years of ice cream making service. Canister: The tall canister design allows the ice cream to come in close contact with the ice and rock salt making it freeze faster. Our canister is manufactured of heavy-duty stainless steel that will provide years of ice cream making service. Dasher: The patented dasher system is constructed of heavy-duty cast iron and is electroplated for lasting durability. It will never warp out of shape like plastic dashers are prone to do. And the beech wood blades are self-adjusting to ensure uniform scraping of the ice cream mixture on the canisters interior sidewall. Dasher: The patented dasher system is constructed of heavy-duty cast iron and is electroplated for lasting durability. It will never warp out of shape like plastic dashers are prone to do. And the beech wood blades are self-adjusting to ensure uniform scraping of the ice cream mixture on the canisters interior sidewall. Bucket Canister Dasher The White Mountain Experience The White Mountain Experience started in the 1850s. Founded in 1853, we’ve always been about making good times happen right at home with ice cream you make yourself. The experience starts with the discussion--often the kids get their pick--of what flavor ice cream your family wants to make. Vanilla with bittersweet chocolate chips or maybe peach made with orchard fresh peaches. Every delicious choice is limited only by your imagination. Just set up your White Mountain ice cream maker with ice and rock salt, and let the fun begin. Whether you’re cooling off a hot summer picnic or warming up a homebound winter weekend, the experience is one you can’t put a price on. Our secret is the triple-motion dasher. At the heart of the White Mountain ice cream maker is a uniquely designed, twin-blade \"dasher.\" The outer canister turns clockwise and the blades turn both clockwise and counter clockwise. That triple-motion action continuously folds the ingredient mixture from the outer walls back onto itself creating the smoothest and creamiest down-home ice cream ever made.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41nbpqxSUFL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"White Mountain","source_asin":"B00002N62G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-375945","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00002N62G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00002N62G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":375946,"name":"jinchan Linen Curtains for Living Room Farmhouse Curtains Semi Sheer Curtains 84 Inches Long Light Filtering for Bedroom Solid Rustic Grommet Window C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nXVldhFUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ready Made: These linen curtains add a touch of nature to your windows. Each panel measures 52\"W x 84\"L from top to end, 2 panels included. Warm up your space with superlative qualities and breathable look and feel of JINCHAN curtains. Rustic Look: With a solid, textured linen blend fabric, these curtains bring both casual freshness and country style to the room. While maintaining simple and generous sensibility, these 84 inches long curtains can match most style in your home. Versatile Use: Letting in just the right light, these neutral look farmhouse curtains act as a light filter and provide privacy to the room. They work well for your bedroom and living room windows, and can also be used as room dividers or closet coverings. Modern Grommets: These grommet ring top curtains feature 8 matte silver rings on each panel. 1.6-inch inner diameter allows for most window curtain rods to go through. These linen drapes take little time to install and are easy to open and close. Easy Care: Our linen blend curtains are durable thanks to the sturdy fabric and top notch sewing quality. They are machine washable in cold water gentle circle and tumble dry in gentle setting, no bleach. Creases due to packing and shipping can be pressed by ironing or steaming.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nXVldhFUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"jinchan","source_asin":"B09FQ12D47","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-375946","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FQ12D47","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FQ12D47","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":375947,"name":"LALAHOO Medicine Cabinet for Bathroom with Mirror, Lighted Bathroom Medicine Cabinet with Outlet, Wall Mounted LED Medicine Cabinet with 2 Glass Shelv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":229.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ov4VAwy9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【💕Bathroom Medicine Cabinet with 3 Color LED Lights】Our bathroom medicine cabinet has adjustable Led Lights. You can change 3 color mode ( 3000K/4000K/6000K) of led light by short press the switch button. You can adjust the brightness of the Led light by long pressing the switch button. Please note that LED medicine cabinets on the market cannot be used as the main light source for makeup. When you want to make up, you need to use the bathroom medicine cabinet with a bathroom lights over mirror. 【💕Medicine Cabinet with Electrical Outlet】LALAHOO led medicine cabinet mirror for bathroom has a 20A, 2000W high-power outlet, which can accept high-power appliances less than 2000W, and can meet your needs for using any bathroom appliance. It can charge electric toothbrush, electric razor and grooming kit, you can even use hair blower through this outlet.CRI 90 high-quality LED lights. It's LED lights can be used as an auxiliary light source for makeup and lighting.It also can be set with 3 color temperatures. 【💕Medicine Cabinet Mirror with Demisting Function】Our bathroom medicine cabinet with vanity mirror & led light has defogging function. You can activate this function by pressing the defogging button. It can quickly remove water mist from the mirror. 【💕Space-Saving】The wall mounted medicine cabinet is a perfect storage solution for the bathroom. Its design maximizes the space of your room. It can be assembled on a wall and comes space-saving, providing extra storage without taking up valuable floor space. This lighted medicine cabinet with mirror offer additional storage for your bathroom. And easily accommodate your personal and bath items such as soaps, toothpaste, and makeup. 【💕No Assembled & Moisture Proof Material】Our medicine cabinet does not require assembly like other cheap medicine cabinets. When you open the package, you will receive an assembled medicine cabinet.The only thing that needs to do is hang the cabinet on the wall and plug it in. And we used better waterproof coating. This makes it more durable. 【💕Well-Packaged & 100% Satisfied Customer Srviece】We do our best to serve every customer. When the mirror cabinet you receive is damaged, please feel free to contact us at any time. And send us photos of the damaged parts of the medicine cabinet and photos of the packaging box. We will provide you with a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ov4VAwy9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LALAHOO","source_asin":"B0C38GYHQ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-375947","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C38GYHQ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C38GYHQ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
